{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":7060967,"ns":0,"title":"Crayford focuser","extract":"The Crayford focuser is a simplified focusing mechanism for amateur astronomical telescopes. Crayford focusers are considered superior to entry-level rack and pinion focusers,  normally found in this type of device.","description":"Focusing mechanism for amateur telescopes","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}